        scheme: ["Force = 3 × 70 × 9.81 = 2060 N", "Compressive stress = 2060/(5.0×10⁻⁴) = 4.1×10⁶ Pa", "Strain = 4.1×10⁶/1.5×10¹⁰ = 2.8×10⁻⁴", "Shortening = 2.8×10⁻⁴ × 0.40 = 1.1×10⁻⁴ m (about 0.11 mm)"],
