        scheme: ["At 400 km altitude, g = GM/r² ≈ 8.7 m s⁻², about 89% of its surface value", "Gravity does not vanish; it is what bends the station's path into an orbit", "The astronauts are in continuous free fall with the station, so there is no contact force to give a sensation of weight"],
