        scheme: ["The grain is bombarded by water molecules from all sides", "In any instant the numbers striking each direction fluctuate — impacts don't cancel exactly", "The resultant imbalance of momentum kicks the visible grain", "Random, never-stopping jitter is direct evidence of molecular motion and momentum transfer"],
