        scheme: ["The biceps attaches centimetres from the elbow; the dumbbell acts tens of centimetres away", "Moments must balance: F_biceps × d_biceps = W_load × d_load", "The tiny muscle lever arm must be offset by a correspondingly huge muscle force"],
